<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady-up $2 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $2.00 per cwt lower, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 56.50-64.50; 700-800 lbs 55.50-59.50; 800-900 lbs 56.75-61.75. Small 1 300-400 lbs 43.00-51.00; 400-500 lbs 43.00-52.50; 500-600 lbs 44.00- 52.00. Medium and Large 2 600-700 lbs 50.00-54.00. Holstein Large 2 Pen 561 lbs 40.00; 700-800 lbs 37.50-43.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 48.00-54.00. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 35.00-37.75; 600-700 lbs 40.50-46.50.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,500</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
